			title: "&9&l1. Welcome to Mekanism & Mekanism: Extras!",
			description: [
				"&7Welcome to the complete, 105-quest industrial engineering masterclass for &bMekanism&7, &aMekanism: Generators&7, &6Mekanism: Ad Astra Ores&7, and &dMekanism: Extras&7!",
				"",
				"&6&lCore Mekanism Rules in Tech, Scales & Rockets:",
				"&8• &eFactory Growth (1 -> 17 Slots!): &7You start with 1-slot machines in Phase 0 and unlock all &a8 Tier Installers&7 across Phases 1A to 7—culminating in &d17-Slot Infinite Factories&7!",
				"&8• &cSacred Armor & Battery Rule: &7The MekaSuit, Meka-Tool, and Alloy Paxel are &c&lremoved&7 to protect the Sacred Armor/Tool Line. Flux Networks batteries are also removed—your sole bulk energy storage is the &aMekanism Induction Matrix&7!",
				"&8• &b5x Planetary Ores: &7Desh, Ostrum, and Calorite work in the full 2x–5x chemical line! (&cRaw Unobtainium is blocked from 2x–5x and requires Cataclysmic Flux in the Combiner!&7)",
				"",
				"&eTip: &7With &bJust Enough Mekanism Multiblocks&7 installed, you can look up exact block counts and sizes for every Mekanism multiblock right inside JEI!"
			],
			x: 0.0, y: 0.0,
