		{
			id: "mek_002_configurator_dictionary",
			title: "&b2. Essential Tools: Configurator & Dictionary",
			description: [
				"&7Every Mekanism engineer needs two handheld tools:",
				"&8• &bConfigurator (&fmekanism:configurator&7): &7Hold &eShift + Scroll Wheel&7 to switch modes (&aConfigurate Items/Fluids/Gases/Energy&7, &eRotate&7, &cEmpty&7, or &bWrench&7). Shift + Right-Click any pipe connection with it to toggle between Normal, &aPULL&7, &cPUSH&7, and &8NONE&7!",
				"&8• &eDictionary (&fmekanism:dictionary&7): &7Right-click any item or block to inspect all of its Item/Block Tags (essential for configuring Digital Miner & Tag Export Bus filters!)."
